name: visual-feedback-loop
description: Use when asked to recreate, clone, match, polish, or visually compare a web page, landing page, component, or app screen against a screenshot, live URL, mockup, or reference; use Playwright, Playwright MCP when available, screenshots, responsive checks, and visual diffs to iterate on layout, typography, colors, spacing, and UI fidelity.
